<h2 class="wp-block-heading alignwide">Welcome to the new Photojournal Website!</h2>



<p class="alignwide has-text-align-wide">Welcome to Photojournal's new web presence on&nbsp;<a href="https://science.nasa.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Science@NASA</a>. Our new site contains all the same great images, animations, and videos as our previous site. We've updated our media <a href="https://science.nasa.gov/photojournal/galleries/" data-type="topic" data-id="1016564">galleries</a>, making them easier to browse and search for content. We hope you enjoy our new site, but if you have questions, comments, or suggestions, please <a href="https://science.nasa.gov/photojournal/feedback/" data-type="topic" data-id="890325">share your thoughts</a> with us.</p>


